<tr valign="top" class="whs15">
<td width="17.233%" class="whs19">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Unselect All</span></p>
</td>
<td width="73.392%" class="whs20">
<p class="normal-table">Unselects marked entities/groups that are selected (or partially selected).</p>
</td>
<td width="9.375%" class="whs21">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Unselect_All.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs22" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs15">
<td width="17.233%" class="whs19">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Hide All</span></p>
</td>
<td width="73.392%" class="whs20">
<p class="normal-table">Hides marked entities/groups.</p>
</td>
<td width="9.375%" class="whs21">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/hide_all.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs22" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs15">
<td width="17.233%" class="whs19">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Hide Selected</span></p>
</td>
<td width="73.392%" class="whs20">
<p class="normal-table">Hides marked entities/groups that are selected (or partially selected).</p>
</td>
<td width="9.375%" class="whs21">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/hide_selection_and_hide_selected.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs22" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs15">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="17.233%" class="whs23">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Show All</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="73.392%" class="whs24">
<p class="normal-table">Shows marked entities. If applied to a group, all its hidden entities will appear, no matter if they are selected or not.</p>
<p class="Note" id="p1"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note</b></span>: Hiding entities (or parts of them) is not stored, i.e. next time when you open the file all entities will be displayed.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="9.375%" class="whs21">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Show_All.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs22" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs15">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="17.233%" class="whs23">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Delete</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="73.392%" class="whs24">
<p class="normal-table">Deletes marked entities/groups. If applied to a group, all entities will be deleted. It is possible to delete hidden entities/groups. There is no undo for this command.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="9.375%" class="whs21">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/delete.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs22" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs15">
<td width="17.233%" class="whs23">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Delete Selection</span></p>
</td>
<td width="73.392%" class="whs24">
<p class="normal-table">Deletes marked selected entities/groups. If an entity is partially selected, calling this command will cause the whole entity to be deleted. If applied to a group, all its entities that are wholly of partially selected, will be deleted. It is not possible to delete hidden entities/groups if the marked set contains hidden entities/groups (with the exception of polylines) the command will be grayed. There is no undo for Delete Selected.</p>
<p class="Note" id="p3"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note</b></span>: If you call the context menu for a single entity/group, this command will be available for the polylines only.</p>
</td>
<td width="9.375%" class="whs21">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/delete_selected.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs22" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<h3>Other Common Commands from the Tree Context Menu</h3>
<p class="whs9"><img src="Images/tree_context_4.gif" width="147px" height="338px" border="0" class="img_whs25" alt=""> &#160;</p>
<table cellspacing="0" width="809" class="whs26">
<col class="whs27">
<col class="whs28">
<col class="whs14">
<tr valign="top" class="whs29">
<td bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="17.345%" class="whs30">
<p class="caption">Command</p>
</td>
<td bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="73.28%" class="whs31">
<p class="caption">Description</p>
</td>
<td bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="9.375%" class="whs18">
<p class="caption">Details</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs32">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="17.345%" class="whs33">
<p class="normal-table-func">Lock in Space</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="73.28%" class="whs34">
<p class="normal-table">Locks single or multiple entities or groups so that they won't be affected when updating the current CS.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="9.375%" class="whs21">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Lock_in_Space.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs22" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs35">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="17.345%" class="whs33">
<p class="normal-table-func">Unlock</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="73.28%" class="whs34">
<p class="normal-table">Unlocks single or multiple entities or groups so that they will be affected when updating the current CS.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="9.375%" class="whs21">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Unlock.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs22" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs36">
<td width="17.345%" class="whs33">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Rename</span></p>
</td>
<td width="73.28%" class="whs34">
<p class="normal-table">Renames single entity or group. This command is grayed if applied to scan data, mesh, or point cloud group these groups have standard names. It is possible to rename hidden entities/groups. Other way for renaming is to mark an entity/group and single click on it. Rename command does not appear if applied to multiple marked entities/groups.</p>
</td>
<td width="9.375%" class="whs21">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Rename.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs22" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs37">
<td width="17.345%" class="whs33">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Properties</span></p>
</td>
<td width="73.28%" class="whs34">
<p class="normal-table">This command accesses the properties dialog for an entity or group. The dialog has two tabs one that contains specific information (e.g. number of points, stripes, triangles, normal, radius, etc.) for a particular type and the other called Common, which contains the extents and size of the entity/group.</p>
<p class="normal-table">&#160;</p>
</td>
<td width="9.375%" class="whs21">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Properties.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs22" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs36">
<td width="17.345%" class="whs33">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Properties (root)</span></p>
</td>
<td width="73.28%" class="whs34">
<p class="normal-table">When this command is called from the context menu for the root of the tree a dialog appears. This dialog contains miscellaneous information about the project operator name, object name, date created, etc. Some of the fields are manually edited; some of them are filled automatically. This information can be printed The parameters of the alignment used to capture the data saved in the file can also be viewed.</p>
</td>
<td width="9.375%" class="whs21">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Project_Properties.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs22" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
