<h2><a name="Visualisation_Commands"></a>Visualisation Commands</h2>
<h3>Common visualisation commands</h3>
<p class="whs38"><img src="tree_context_menu_files/image028.gif" width="297px" height="146px" border="0" class="img_whs39" alt=""> <img src="../Working_with_data/Visualisation_files/image029.gif" width="219px" height="46px" border="0" class="img_whs40" alt=""></p>
<table cellspacing="0" width="809" class="whs41">
<col class="whs42">
<col class="whs43">
<col class="whs14">
<tr valign="top" class="whs15">
<td bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="17.346%" class="whs44">
<p class="caption">Command</p>
</td>
<td bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="73.279%" class="whs45">
<p class="caption">Description</p>
</td>
<td bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="9.375%" class="whs18">
<p class="caption">Details</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs15">
<td rowspan="1" colspan="3" width="100%" class="whs46">
<p class="normal-table"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Rendering submenu</b></span> - this command is available for all entities and groups except for the datum entities.</p>
<p class="Note" id="P4"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note:</b></span> Changing rendering is not stored, therefore objects will be rendered in their default modes (<span class="Mode">Smooth Shaded</span> for scan data and meshes, <span class="Mode">Large Points</span> for point clouds, and <span class="Mode">Polygons</span> for polylines) the next time that the file is opened.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs15">
<td width="17.346%" class="whs47">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Points</span></p>
</td>
<td width="73.279%" class="whs48">
<p class="normal-table">Draw only objects vertices as points. This mode is applied for scan data, meshes, point clouds, and polylines.</p>
</td>
<td width="9.375%" class="whs21">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Rendering_Points_and_Points_Mode.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs22" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs15">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="17.346%" class="whs47">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Large Points</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="73.279%" class="whs48">
<p class="normal-table">Draw only objects vertices as large points. This mode is applied for scan data, meshes, point clouds, and polylines.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="9.375%" class="whs21">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Rendering_Large_Points_and_Large_Points_Mode.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs22" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs15">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="17.346%" class="whs47">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Wireframe</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="73.279%" class="whs48">
<p class="normal-table">Draw objects as connected triangles. This mode is applied for scan data, meshes, and polylines. Triangles are used for scan data and meshes only. Polylines are drawn as connected lines.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="9.375%" class="whs21">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Rendering_Polygons_and_Polygons_Mode.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs22" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs15">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="17.346%" class="whs47">
<p class="normal-table-func">Flat</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="73.279%" class="whs48">
<p class="normal-table">Draw objects as connected triangles each of which is shaded depending on the angle of its normal to the light direction in the scene. This mode is applied for scan data and meshes only.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="9.375%" class="whs21">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Rendering_Flat_and_Flat_Shaded_Mode.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs22" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs15">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="17.346%" class="whs47">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Flat + Wireframe</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="73.279%" class="whs48">
<p class="normal-table">Draw objects as combination of flat shaded surface and wireframe.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="9.375%" class="whs21">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/rendering_flat_wireframe_and_flat_wireframe_mode.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs22" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
